---
import "@fristil/designsystem/button.css"
import "@fristil/designsystem/tokens.css"
import "@fristil/designsystem/utilities.css"
import FristilLogo from "../components/FristilLogo.astro"
import "../styles/custom-pages-tailwind.css"
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nb" class="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Fristil designsystem</title>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-50 antialiased">
  <div class="flex min-h-screen flex-col">
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-zinc-800/80 bg-zinc-950/88 backdrop-blur-xl">
    <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl items-center justify-between gap-6 px-4 py-5 sm:px-8">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-inherit no-underline">
          <FristilLogo size="sm" />
      </a>
      <nav>
          <ul class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 sm:gap-8 sm:text-base">
            <li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/introduksjon/">Dokumentasjon</a></li>
            <li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/components/button/">Komponenter</a></li>
            <li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-white" href="https://github.com/MarkusAugust/fristil" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="flex-1">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pb-20 pt-16 sm:pb-28 sm:pt-24">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_18%_18%,rgba(0,242,254,0.16),transparent_30%),radial-gradient(circle_at_82%_8%,rgba(177,92,255,0.14),transparent_34%),radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_100%,rgba(79,172,254,0.10),transparent_40%)]"></div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl gap-12 px-4 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(20rem,0.8fr)] lg:items-center">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="mb-8 inline-flex rounded-full border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 shadow-[0_16px_40px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]">
          CSS-klasser og web components, ingen rammeverk påkrevd
        </div>
        <FristilLogo size="lg" className="mb-8" />
        <h1 class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2 bg-linear-to-br  from-cyan-300 via-blue-400 to-fuchsia-400 bg-clip-text wrap-anywhere text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-transparent sm:text-5xl">
          <span>Rammeverksuavhengig</span><span>designsystem</span>
      </h1>
        <p class="mb-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-zinc-300 sm:text-xl">
          Komponentene er CSS-klasser og web components, altså ting nettleseren allerede forstår. Bruker teamet React, Vue, Svelte eller ingenting, er det samme system og samme API. Et designsystem bundet til ett rammeverk må skrives om når rammeverket byttes ut. Nettleserens egne API-er byttes ikke ut.
        </p>
        <div class="flex w-full max-w-xl flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="/kom-i-gang/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-linear-to-br from-cyan-300 via-blue-400 to-fuchsia-400 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-zinc-950 shadow-[0_18px_38px_-24px_rgba(79,172,254,0.45)] transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_22px_44px_-24px_rgba(79,172,254,0.55)] sm:w-auto">
          Kom i gang
        </a>
          <a href="/components/button/" class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-900/90 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-zinc-100 transition hover:border-blue-400 hover:bg-zinc-900 sm:w-auto">
          Se komponenter
        </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/72 p-6 shadow-[0_28px_80px_-42px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-8">
        <p class="mb-6 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-400">Dette får du</p>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/90 bg-zinc-950/80 p-5">
            <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">Prisen følger problemet</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">En knapp koster én CSS-klasse. Et datofelt koster en web component. Ingenting drar med seg mer maskineri enn det trenger.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/90 bg-zinc-950/80 p-5">
            <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">Tilgjengelighet én gang</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">Koblingen mellom ledetekst, felt, hjelpetekst og feilmelding er fem steder å gjøre feil per felt. Systemet gjør den, ikke hver app.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800/90 bg-zinc-950/80 p-5">
            <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">Ta det i bruk gradvis</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">Begynn med tokens og noen knapper. Hent resten når du trenger det. Ingenting krever at du tar alt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-24 pt-2 sm:pt-4">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-8">
      <div class="mb-10 max-w-2xl">
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-400">Arkitektur</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Tre kategorier, delt etter hvor mye de tar over for deg</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="group rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/86 p-8 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-42px_rgba(0,0,0,0.88)] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-400/70 hover:shadow-[0_30px_80px_-42px_rgba(79,172,254,0.3)]">
          <div class="mb-4 text-4xl">🎨</div>
          <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold">css</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">
            En klasse på et vanlig HTML-element. Ingen JavaScript lastes. Varianter styres med dataattributter.
          </p>
          <code class="mt-4 block text-xs text-zinc-400">&lt;button class="fs-button"&gt;</code>
        </article>
        <article class="group rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/86 p-8 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-42px_rgba(0,0,0,0.88)] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-cyan-400/70 hover:shadow-[0_30px_80px_-42px_rgba(0,242,254,0.3)]">
          <div class="mb-4 text-4xl">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold">ramme</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">
            Du legger inn din egen HTML. Komponenten kobler ledetekst, felt og feilmelding sammen, og lar elementene bli liggende i vanlig DOM.
          </p>
          <code class="mt-4 block text-xs text-zinc-400">&lt;fs-field&gt;…&lt;/fs-field&gt;</code>
        </article>
        <article class="group rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/86 p-8 shadow-[0_24px_70px_-42px_rgba(0,0,0,0.88)] transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-fuchsia-400/70 hover:shadow-[0_30px_80px_-42px_rgba(177,92,255,0.3)]">
          <div class="mb-4 text-4xl">🔒</div>
          <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold">frittstående</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-300">
            Komponenten bygger alt selv. For tilfeller der flere deler må holdes i synk, som et datofelt der tekst og kalender alltid viser det samme.
          </p>
          <code class="mt-4 block text-xs text-zinc-400">&lt;fs-date-field label="Reisedato"&gt;</code>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/90 py-10 text-center text-sm text-zinc-300">
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-8">
      <p>&copy; 2026 Fristil, rammeverksuavhengig designsystem.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
